{
  "name": "NorthStar · Entrega de leads presentados a Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "NO PROBADO EN UNA INSTANCIA REAL DE N8N. Flujo de NorthStar Captación.\n\nRecibe el webhook firmado de Configuración > Entrega a NorthStar (esquema northstar.handoff.v1) y agrega una fila a la hoja de NorthStar. 1) Pega la URL de producción de este webhook en Configuración > Entrega a NorthStar y copia el secreto que muestra el CRM UNA vez. 2) En el nodo \"Config\" pega ese secreto en handoff_secret y el ID de la hoja en el nodo de Google Sheets. 3) El nodo \"Verificar firma\" necesita el módulo crypto: en n8n alojado por ti, NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto; en n8n Cloud confirma que se permite o sustituye ese nodo por una verificación equivalente. Sin firma válida responde 401 y NO escribe en la hoja.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "ce87e8e3-4429-3888-1cbc-81181810e525",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -330
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "northstar-handoff",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": true
        }
      },
      "id": "799a08b6-94ff-c3ce-b06f-f45f1685da3e",
      "name": "Webhook del CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "1ca8c8eb-135e-b692-89be-a4f42eb8242d"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "s1",
              "name": "handoff_secret",
              "value": "PEGAR_AQUI_EL_SECRETO_DE_ENTREGA",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "94528cd3-4488-c44b-3778-a828fa754200",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const crypto = require('crypto');\nconst item = $input.first();\nconst secret = item.json.handoff_secret;\nconst h = item.json.headers || {};\nconst ts = String(h['x-ns-timestamp'] || '');\nconst sig = String(h['x-ns-signature'] || '');\nconst raw = item.binary && item.binary.data ? Buffer.from(item.binary.data.data, 'base64').toString('utf8') : '';\nconst expected = 'sha256=' + crypto.createHmac('sha256', secret).update(ts + '.' + raw).digest('hex');\nconst fresh = Math.abs(Date.now() / 1000 - Number(ts)) <= 300;\nconst a = Buffer.from(sig), b = Buffer.from(expected);\nconst valid = fresh && secret && !secret.startsWith('PEGAR') && a.length === b.length && crypto.timingSafeEqual(a, b);\nreturn [{ json: { valid: !!valid, body: item.json.body } }];"
      },
      "id": "b75c741d-19fb-37ca-ce20-9bc63da110cf",
      "name": "Verificar firma",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "v1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "98a3d1bc-10e9-6a98-f32a-9b03d8ac7738",
      "name": "¿Firma válida?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REEMPLAZAR_ID_DE_LA_HOJA"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Leads"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Fecha de entrega": "={{ $json.body.sent_at }}",
            "Lead ID": "={{ $json.body.lead.id }}",
            "Nombre": "={{ $json.body.lead.name }}",
            "Perfil": "={{ $json.body.lead.profile }}",
            "Teléfono": "={{ $json.body.lead.phone }}",
            "Correo": "={{ $json.body.lead.email }}",
            "Estado": "={{ $json.body.lead.state }}",
            "Equipo": "={{ ($json.body.lead.equipment || []).join(', ') }}",
            "Camiones": "={{ $json.body.lead.truck_count }}",
            "Años de experiencia": "={{ $json.body.lead.years_experience }}",
            "USDOT": "={{ $json.body.lead.usdot }}",
            "Puntuación": "={{ $json.body.lead.score }}",
            "Temperatura": "={{ $json.body.lead.temperature }}",
            "Banderas rojas": "={{ ($json.body.lead.red_flags || []).join(', ') }}",
            "Fuente": "={{ $json.body.lead.attribution && $json.body.lead.attribution.source }}",
            "Confirmar: firmó": "={{ $json.body.confirm_urls && $json.body.confirm_urls.signed }}",
            "Confirmar: rechazado": "={{ $json.body.confirm_urls && $json.body.confirm_urls.rejected }}",
            "Evento": "={{ $json.body.event }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c2746336-8012-3927-31fa-38eb86737fce",
      "name": "Agregar fila a Google Sheets",
